WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.085 --> 00:00:14.672
"Why won't Wukong help us?"

2
00:00:15.032 --> 00:00:16.333
the horse asked Bajie.

3
00:00:18.434 --> 00:00:19.134
pig sighed.

4
00:00:19.154 --> 00:00:22.856
"He told us not to look for him if we needed help.

5
00:00:23.637 --> 00:00:26.578
Plus I kept telling Master to use the Tight Headband spell.

6
00:00:27.679 --> 00:00:29.800
I'll bet the monkey is really mad at me."

7
00:00:30.968 --> 00:00:33.089
"That doesn't matter now," said the horse.

8
00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:35.871
"You must get Wukong to come back."

9
00:00:36.891 --> 00:00:42.835
Bajie hesitated for a moment and then leaped onto a cloud.

10
00:00:43.815 --> 00:00:47.817
He soared through the sky and soon arrived at the Fruit and Flower Mountain.

11
00:00:48.718 --> 00:00:51.699
He found Wukong sitting beside the big waterfall.

12
00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.301
monkeys and apes were nearby.

13
00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:56.922
They held swords and spears.

14
00:00:57.583 --> 00:00:59.784
They stared at Bajie silently.

15
00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:03.401
"Hello, Wukong," said the pig.

16
00:01:03.421 --> 00:01:05.381
"This is a lovely mountain."

17
00:01:06.642 --> 00:01:07.902
Wukong scowled.

18
00:01:08.682 --> 00:01:10.523
"What are you doing here, Bajie?"

19
00:01:12.143 --> 00:01:13.464
The pig looked at the ground.

20
00:01:13.484 --> 00:01:18.385
"The Tang Monk would like you to come back," he mumbled.

21
00:01:18.405 --> 00:01:22.827
"Well, that's too bad," said Wukong, standing up.

22
00:01:23.887 --> 00:01:24.707
told me to leave.

23
00:01:25.268 --> 00:01:31.404
I'll never help him again."

24
00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:33.565
come back," said Bajie.

25
00:01:33.585 --> 00:01:35.385
"We all miss you."

26
00:01:35.465 --> 00:01:38.686
"I don't miss said Wukong.

27
00:01:38.706 --> 00:01:42.047
"You told Master to use the Tight Headband spell.

28
00:01:43.188 --> 00:01:45.908
I should take out my iron bar and clobber you!"

29
00:01:49.489 --> 00:01:50.290
forced a laugh.

30
00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.571
"I was just joking, Wukong.

31
00:01:54.691 --> 00:01:57.752
I knew you were really just protecting Master."

32
00:02:00.316 --> 00:02:02.458
wasn't funny," said Wukong.

33
00:02:02.478 --> 00:02:06.661
"That spell really hurts!"

34
00:02:10.564 --> 00:02:12.065
The pig began to cry.

35
00:02:13.086 --> 00:02:13.667
come back.

36
00:02:14.647 --> 00:02:17.630
The Tang Monk is in danger—big danger.

37
00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:20.212
monster turned him into a tiger.

38
00:02:20.792 --> 00:02:22.413
And Wujing was captured."

39
00:02:24.775 --> 00:02:25.756
Wukong shrugged.

40
00:02:27.052 --> 00:02:29.933
"Just tell the monster that you're friends with me, the Monkey King.

41
00:02:30.873 --> 00:02:33.454
He'll be scared and leave all of you alone."

42
00:02:33.474 --> 00:02:39.416
"Oh, I did tell him about you," Bajie lied.

43
00:02:41.456 --> 00:02:42.997
Wukong leaned closer.

44
00:02:43.017 --> 00:02:44.497
"What did he say?"

45
00:02:46.518 --> 00:02:47.258
bit his lip.

46
00:02:48.719 --> 00:02:54.552
"He laughed and said that you're a tiny little coward."

47
00:02:54.632 --> 00:02:56.954
Wukong's eyes blazed with fury.

48
00:02:56.974 --> 00:03:00.117
"He will regret saying that!

49
00:03:01.298 --> 00:03:13.109
Let's go, The monster sat in the dining hall, still disguised as a handsome young man.

50
00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:16.452
He was eating a meal with the king and the queen.

51
00:03:17.493 --> 00:03:20.576
A servant came in and handed a note to the young man.

52
00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:27.321
The young man read the note and stood up.

53
00:03:27.341 --> 00:03:31.042
"I'm sorry, Your Majesty, but I must go."

54
00:03:32.542 --> 00:03:33.922
He ran out of the dining hall.

55
00:03:35.783 --> 00:03:39.404
From behind a pillar, the servant watched the man leave.

56
00:03:40.604 --> 00:03:44.105
Light sparkled, and the servant turned into Bajie.

57
00:03:46.246 --> 00:03:47.066
The pig giggled.

58
00:03:47.586 --> 00:03:49.987
"The monster is going to be so surprised!"

59
00:03:51.147 --> 00:03:54.548
The young man ran outside and turned back into a monster.

60
00:03:55.904 --> 00:03:58.887
He flew through the air and returned to his pagoda.

61
00:04:01.029 --> 00:04:02.650
He burst through the door in a panic.

62
00:04:03.671 --> 00:04:06.533
Then he saw Princess Hundred Flowers and relaxed.

63
00:04:06.553 --> 00:04:08.855
"Oh, my sweet!"

64
00:04:09.256 --> 00:04:09.816
he cried.

65
00:04:09.836 --> 00:04:11.958
"I was so scared.

66
00:04:12.939 --> 00:04:14.700
I thought I had lost you forever!"

67
00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:17.483
"Why did you think that?"

68
00:04:17.863 --> 00:04:18.684
asked the princess.

69
00:04:20.645 --> 00:04:21.726
The monster sighed.

70
00:04:21.746 --> 00:04:23.248
"I got a note.

71
00:04:24.464 --> 00:04:29.667
It said there was a monkey here, and he was trying to destroy my pagoda."

72
00:04:29.687 --> 00:04:33.769
"A monkey was here earlier," said the princess.

73
00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:36.691
said the monster.

74
00:04:37.231 --> 00:04:37.971
He looked around.

75
00:04:39.492 --> 00:04:41.053
didn't destroy the pagoda.

76
00:04:41.994 --> 00:04:42.874
What did he want?"

77
00:04:44.015 --> 00:04:45.335
The princess hesitated.

78
00:04:45.355 --> 00:04:49.818
"You're not going to be happy about this," she said.

79
00:04:49.838 --> 00:04:53.640
"But he freed the purple spirit you had captured."

80
00:04:54.612 --> 00:04:56.113
The monster looked angry.

81
00:04:56.133 --> 00:05:03.878
"How dare he—" "The monkey did something else too," said the princess.

82
00:05:04.719 --> 00:05:05.600
"What did he do?"

83
00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:06.920
asked the monster.

84
00:05:08.061 --> 00:05:09.182
was a flash of light.

85
00:05:10.863 --> 00:05:13.385
Suddenly Wukong stood before the monster.

86
00:05:14.746 --> 00:05:15.746
monkey smiled.

87
00:05:15.766 --> 00:05:17.588
"I freed the princess
